  "cards": [
    {
      "title": "Reading Order",
      "dot": "cyan",
      "items": [
        "Main path: embeddings with optional vision → one mHC expansion → 45 sequential layers → stream mean and final RMSNorm → LM head.",
        "Layers 4–43 are 40 layers: ten KDA/KDA/KDA/DSA groups. Including 0–3 and 44 gives 34 KDA and 11 DSA layers.",
        "Attention and FFN types are independent: three dense FFNs and 42 MoEs. DSA is not an extra sublayer after KDA."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Scope",
      "dot": "amber",
      "items": [
        "Logical architecture of the pinned checkpoint. TP/EP partitions and kernel fusion are not depicted.",
        "MTP consumes runtime-aligned hidden states and next-token embeddings in a separate draft path, not a mandatory 46th target layer.",
        "Configuration: HF 46a050bec13002ad29ee795c16e61cf4fa3c4a9c. Source: SGLang 92580581da6fc8542a997a00c1a8b71b03497680."
      ]
    }
  ],
